	(text "Terminal side B_IN+ / B_IN-, bank B_BUS+. HPE501 250 A aR in both poles (breaks 1.25-50 kA only).\nContactor opens <= 0.97 kA, held above (port_spec lean). Installation: upstream clears 967-1250 A within 0.26 s."
